sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    participant C1 as Cliente A
    participant C2 as Cliente B
    participant API as API REST
    participant RS as ReservationService
    participant REPO as ReservationRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C1,DB: Cenário 1: Reserva bem-sucedida

    C1->>API: POST /api/reservations
    API->>RS: create(spaceId, startDate, endDate)
    RS->>RS: ensureDateRange()
    RS->>RS: ensureUserExists()
    RS->>RS: ensureSpaceExists()
    RS->>REPO: countOverlaps(spaceId, start, end)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) WHERE space_id = ? AND NOT (end <= start OR start >= end)
    DB-->>REPO: count: 0
    REPO-->>RS: 0 conflitos
    RS->>REPO: create(reservation)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations
    DB-->>REPO: OK
    REPO-->>RS: Reservation
    RS-->>API: Reservation
    API-->>C1: 201 Created

    Note over C1,DB: Cenário 2: Double-booking bloqueado

    C2->>API: POST /api/reservations (mesmo espaço/horário)
    API->>RS: create(spaceId, startDate, endDate)
    RS->>RS: ensureDateRange()
    RS->>RS: ensureUserExists()
    RS->>RS: ensureSpaceExists()
    RS->>REPO: countOverlaps(spaceId, start, end)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) WHERE space_id = ? AND NOT (end <= start OR start >= end)
    DB-->>REPO: count: 1
    REPO-->>RS: 1 conflito!
    RS--xAPI: AppError(409, "Espaço já reservado nesse período")
    API--xC2: 409 Conflict
